Package: viditron
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, ffmpeg, gstreamer1.0-plugins-base, gstreamer1.0-plugins-good, gstreamer1.0-plugins-bad, gstreamer1.0-libav
Recommends: yt-dlp
Description: quick GTK frontend for common FFmpeg video edits
 Viditron provides a graphical interface for downloading, trimming, cropping,
 rotating and adjusting video and audio. It builds an FFmpeg filter chain and
 exports the edited result without modifying the original file.
